  "notes": [
    "Original heads retain source RGB at scale 1 and integer translation.",
    "South/North torso slots extract exact original source cloth; source body axes center the visible trunk independently of neck sockets.",
    "Upper sleeves and forearm/hands are separate rigid bones; S/N use a small common projected depth scale per pose.",
    "South sleeve caps pass behind torso while distal hands/cuffs pass in front.",
    "Lower art is repacked into standard slots; gait geometry is preserved.",
    "Jump and seated fallback arms use the same rigid two-bone chains as walking.",
    "Visual approval remains a parent/owner gate."
  ]
